      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/f19dbf/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-18T22:32:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Long-time lurker, first time poster,</p>\n<p>I wanted to throw in because I saw this after I sent an email to the contact address so I sent a follow up to Paul, it looks like you guys check the forums more than your email.&nbsp; I was excited today to open my gtg box expecting to see a sentinels tatics tourney bundle, and then I sadly find the hobby painters bundle instead, was really looking forward to playing so hopefully you guys can help me out.</p>",
